Input: {"question": "Who operates Acilia train station?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 20, "text": "Acilia Train Station"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 22, "end": 113, "text": "Acilia Train Station is a major railway station located in Acilia, a suburb of Rome, Italy."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 114, "end": 264, "text": "While it may seem unusual, the station is operated by Aeroflot, the flag carrier of Russia, in a unique partnership that has been in place since 2010."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 265, "end": 285, "text": "History of Operation"}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 287, "end": 451, "text": "The partnership between Acilia Train Station and Aeroflot began in 2008, when the Italian government launched a bid to privatize several state-owned train stations."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 452, "end": 576, "text": "Aeroflot, looking to expand its presence in the European market, submitted a successful bid to operate Acilia Train Station."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 577, "end": 680, "text": "The deal was finalized in 2010, with Aeroflot taking over management of the station on January 1, 2011."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 681, "end": 684, "text": "[1]"}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 686, "end": 763, "text": "Studies have shown that the partnership has been beneficial for both parties."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 764, "end": 975, "text": "A 2012 study published in the Journal of Transportation Economics found that the partnership resulted in a 25% increase in passenger traffic at Acilia Train Station, as well as a 15% decrease in operating costs."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 976, "end": 1151, "text": "[2] A follow-up study in 2015 found that the partnership had also led to improved customer satisfaction, with 90% of passengers reporting a positive experience at the station."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1152, "end": 1155, "text": "[3]"}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1157, "end": 1167, "text": "Operations"}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1169, "end": 1246, "text": "Aeroflot operates Acilia Train Station through its subsidiary, Aeroflot Rail."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1247, "end": 1378, "text": "The company is responsible for managing the day-to-day operations of the station, including ticketing, scheduling, and maintenance."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1379, "end": 1582, "text": "Despite being operated by a Russian company, the station still maintains strong ties to the Italian rail network, with frequent trains connecting to Rome's Termini Station and other major Italian cities."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1583, "end": 1593, "text": "References"}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1595, "end": 1651, "text": "[1] \"Aeroflot Wins Bid to Operate Acilia Train Station\"."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1652, "end": 1682, "text": "Railway Gazette International."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1683, "end": 1694, "text": "2010-02-15."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1695, "end": 1796, "text": "[2] \"The Effects of Privatization on Train Station Operations: A Case Study of Acilia Train Station\"."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1797, "end": 1833, "text": "Journal of Transportation Economics."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1834, "end": 1845, "text": "2012-06-01."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1846, "end": 1917, "text": "[3] \"Customer Satisfaction at Acilia Train Station: A Follow-Up Study\"."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1918, "end": 1953, "text": "Journal of Transportation Research."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1954, "end": 1965, "text": "2015-03-01."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1966, "end": 2025, "text": "[4] \"Aeroflot Rail: A New Era in Train Station Management\"."}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2026, "end": 2049, "text": "Aeroflot Annual Report."}, "D1S29": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2050, "end": 2055, "text": "2011."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 114, "text": "**HEADLINE:** Acilia Train Station Under the Helm of Cotral: A Partnership for Efficient Public Transport in Lazio"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 116, "end": 319, "text": "**ROME, ITALY** - In a move to streamline public transportation in the Lazio region, Acilia train station has officially come under the operation of Cotral, the region's premier public transport company."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 320, "end": 461, "text": "This partnership aims to enhance the travel experience for commuters, providing a seamless and efficient connection to the surrounding areas."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 462, "end": 639, "text": "According to Cotral's official website, the company has been entrusted with the management of Acilia train station, which serves as a vital hub for residents and visitors alike."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 640, "end": 837, "text": "\"We are committed to providing top-notch services to our passengers, and our partnership with Acilia train station is a testament to our dedication to improving public transport in Lazio,\" said Dr."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 838, "end": 892, "text": "Maria Rossi, CEO of Cotral, in an exclusive interview."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 893, "end": 1128, "text": "Data from the Italian National Institute of Statistics (ISTAT) reveals that the Lazio region has witnessed a significant increase in population growth, with over 5.8 million residents relying on public transport to navigate the region."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1129, "end": 1287, "text": "Cotral's operation of Acilia train station is expected to cater to this growing demand, ensuring that commuters have access to reliable and frequent services."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1288, "end": 1482, "text": "\"Cotral's expertise in public transport management will undoubtedly benefit the community, providing a more efficient and integrated service at Acilia train station,\" stated Mayor of Acilia, Mr."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1483, "end": 1520, "text": "Giovanni Bianchi, in a press release."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1521, "end": 1649, "text": "\"We are confident that this partnership will have a positive impact on the local economy and quality of life for our residents.\""}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1650, "end": 1838, "text": "In terms of statistics, Cotral's operation of Acilia train station is expected to result in a 20% increase in passenger traffic, with an estimated 10,000 commuters using the station daily."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1839, "end": 1975, "text": "This growth is anticipated to generate significant revenue for the local economy, with an estimated €1.5 million in annual ticket sales."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1976, "end": 2209, "text": "The partnership between Cotral and Acilia train station is a welcome development for commuters, who can now expect improved services, including enhanced security measures, modernized infrastructure, and increased frequency of trains."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2210, "end": 2216, "text": "As Dr."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2217, "end": 2414, "text": "Rossi emphasized, \"Our goal is to provide a comfortable and convenient travel experience for our passengers, and we are committed to investing in the necessary resources to achieve this objective.\""}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2415, "end": 2558, "text": "In conclusion, the operation of Acilia train station by Cotral is a significant step forward in enhancing public transport in the Lazio region."}}, "candidates": [], "original_cards": [], "initial_answers": ["Aeroflot", "Cotral"]}
